    "name": "Neverending Check-in: The Hotel Stories",
    "steam_appid": 2444850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome to '<strong>The Neverending Check-In: The Hotel Stories</strong>', an enchanting 2D pixel RPG that invites you on an extraordinary adventure. <strong>Step into a mesmerizing hotel where each check-in unveils a new chapter of its captivating past.</strong><br><br>In this immersive game, you find yourself tasked with a grand mission\u2014<u>to rebuild the once-glorious hotel to its former splendor.</u> As you delve into the depths of the hotel, encounter a multitude of quests, mysteries, and challenges that will test your resolve.<br><br>Engage with a diverse cast of characters, from quirky staff members to intriguing guests, each with their own stories to tell. Forge meaningful relationships, uncover secrets, and witness the transformation of both the hotel and its inhabitants as you progress.<br><br>Embark on thrilling quests that will take you on epic adventures, humorous escapades, and heartwarming journeys. Solve puzzles, navigate through intricate mazes, and overcome obstacles as you unravel the captivating narratives within the hotel's walls.<br><br>Prepare to be delighted by clever humor with slices of sarcasm and witty references to known universes that add an extra layer of excitement and nostalgia to your journey. Every step you take brings you closer to the heart of the hotel's history and the secrets it holds.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the meticulously crafted pixel art, breathe life back into the hotel's enchanting spaces, and witness its transformation from a forgotten relic to a vibrant hub of life and wonder.<br><br><strong>And did we mention cats?</strong> Discover the secret lives of feline companions and the unexpected role they play in the grand scheme of things.<br><br>Are you ready to embark on a quest that will challenge your mind, touch your heart, and reignite the glory of 'The Neverending Check-In: The Hotel Stories'?<br><br><strong>The story awaits your arrival.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to '<strong>The Neverending Check-In: The Hotel Stories</strong>', an enchanting 2D pixel RPG that invites you on an extraordinary adventure. <strong>Step into a mesmerizing hotel where each check-in unveils a new chapter of its captivating past.</strong><br><br>In this immersive game, you find yourself tasked with a grand mission\u2014<u>to rebuild the once-glorious hotel to its former splendor.</u> As you delve into the depths of the hotel, encounter a multitude of quests, mysteries, and challenges that will test your resolve.<br><br>Engage with a diverse cast of characters, from quirky staff members to intriguing guests, each with their own stories to tell. Forge meaningful relationships, uncover secrets, and witness the transformation of both the hotel and its inhabitants as you progress.<br><br>Embark on thrilling quests that will take you on epic adventures, humorous escapades, and heartwarming journeys. Solve puzzles, navigate through intricate mazes, and overcome obstacles as you unravel the captivating narratives within the hotel's walls.<br><br>Prepare to be delighted by clever humor with slices of sarcasm and witty references to known universes that add an extra layer of excitement and nostalgia to your journey. Every step you take brings you closer to the heart of the hotel's history and the secrets it holds.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the meticulously crafted pixel art, breathe life back into the hotel's enchanting spaces, and witness its transformation from a forgotten relic to a vibrant hub of life and wonder.<br><br><strong>And did we mention cats?</strong> Discover the secret lives of feline companions and the unexpected role they play in the grand scheme of things.<br><br>Are you ready to embark on a quest that will challenge your mind, touch your heart, and reignite the glory of 'The Neverending Check-In: The Hotel Stories'?<br><br><strong>The story awaits your arrival.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in The Neverending Check-In, a pixel RPG filled with mystery, quests, cats, humor and life universe. Rebuild a once-glorious hotel and uncover its secret past in this captivating journey of deep plots, lively characters, and abundant quests.",
